$* Synthetic example for Catalog Studio import, not an E3D runtime test.
NEW PTSET /DEMO-READ-POINTS
DESC |Sample connector points|
NEW PTAXI
NUMB 1 PAXI -X PDIS (PARA[3] / 2)
PBOR (PARA[1])
NEW PTCAR
NUMB 2 PX (PARA[3] / 2) PY 0 PZ 0 PTCDIR X
PBOR (PARA[1])
END PTSET

NEW GMSET /DEMO-READ-SHAPES
NEW SCYL
PAXI -X PDIS (PARA[3] / 2)
PHEI (-PARA[3]) PDIA (PARA[2])
OBST 2 TUFL TRUE CLFL FALSE
END GMSET
